[83.86121, "o", "    ✓ bash — exit 0\r\n  qwen3.6-35b — 12 tool call(s) so far\r\n  ⚙ verify pytest -q\r\n  ⚙ verify — the check could not run (exit 127). Not counted against the work; fix [verify] command.\r\nThe query executes successfully and returns the top 3 product IDs by sales for each category in Q4 2024.\r\n\r\nThe SQL query in `/app/answer.sql`:\r\n1. Joins `orders` with `products` on `product_id`\r\n2. Filters to Q4 2024 (Oct 1 – Dec 31)\r\n3. Computes total sales per product per category (`SUM(quantity * unit_price)`)\r\n4. Ranks products within each category by sales descending using `ROW_NUMBER()`\r\n5. Returns the top 3 per category\r\n\r\n[result] role=implementor model=qwen3.6-35b tools=12 surface=8778cc4595e4\r\n"]
